OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with making explosives
OL,4,Aafter street evacuation                
OL,6,FA man has been charged with making     
OL,7,Fexplosives after dozens of residents   
OL,8,Fwere forced to leave their homes.      
OL,10,FPeople from 23 houses on Shelley Grove 
OL,11,Fin Droylsden, Manchester, were         
OL,12,Fevacuated on 18 November after police  
OL,13,Fsaid a discovery had been made during  
OL,14,Fan "unrelated investigation". They were
OL,15,Fonly able to return six days later.    
OL,17,FJames Quinn, 29, of Shelley Grove, in  
OL,18,FDroylsden, has been charged with six   
OL,19,Fcounts of making or possessing an      
OL,20,Fexplosive substance under suspicious   
OL,21,Fcircumstances.                         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
