OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with making explosives
OL,4,Aafter street evacuation                
OL,6,FHe has also been charged with          
OL,7,Fpossession of a gun and ammunition,    
OL,8,Farson, criminal damage and supplying   
OL,9,Fclass A drugs. He is due to appear at  
OL,10,FStockport Magistrates' Court.          
